  "sn3.24:1.4": "",
  "sn3.24:1.5": "Also asked by the brahmin Devahita at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn7.13/en/sujato#7.2'>SN 7.13:7.2</a> and by Sakka at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn11.16/en/sujato#2.4'>SN 11.16:2.4</a>. ",
  "sn3.24:1.6": "Giving is not purely a matter of utilitarian calculation. It creates an emotional connection, which is why giving with one’s own hands is important. It’s not just about helping another; it’s also about elevating oneself. ",
  "sn3.24:1.7": "",
  "sn3.24:1.8": "",
  "sn3.24:1.9": "",
  "sn3.24:1.10": "",
  "sn3.24:1.11": "",
  "sn3.24:1.12": "",
  "sn3.24:1.13": "",
  "sn3.24:1.14": "Note that, while the <i lang='pi' translate='no'>khattiyas</i> were often said to be the warrior class, there is no difference here. ",
